---
title: Medra — Platform Overview (how everyone connects)
---
flowchart TD
    classDef patient fill:#E4F0F5,stroke:#2F8BAC,color:#0F2233;
    classDef doctor fill:#E6F5EE,stroke:#2FA36B,color:#0F2233;
    classDef admin fill:#FBF1DD,stroke:#E0A32E,color:#0F2233;
    classDef platform fill:#EAF1F5,stroke:#1B3A5B,color:#0F2233;
    classDef data fill:#0F2233,stroke:#39B0CF,color:#FFFFFF;
    classDef hub fill:#39B0CF,stroke:#1B3A5B,color:#FFFFFF;

    P([👤 Patient<br/>free]):::patient
    IA([🏥 Institution Admin<br/>paid subscription]):::admin
    DR([🩺 Doctor / Staff]):::doctor
    PP([👨‍⚕️ Private Practitioner<br/>paid subscription]):::doctor
    PA([🛡️ Platform Admin<br/>Medra team]):::platform

    MEDRA{{Medra Platform}}:::hub
    DB[(Unified Medical<br/>Records Database)]:::data

    PA -- approves & verifies --> IA
    PA -- verifies MDCN --> DR
    PA -- verifies MDCN --> PP
    PA -- configures plans --> MEDRA

    IA -- registers clinic, adds --> DR
    IA -- allocates bookings to --> DR
    P -- searches & books --> MEDRA
    MEDRA -- routes booking --> IA
    MEDRA -- direct booking --> PP
    DR -- writes consultation note --> DB
    PP -- writes consultation note --> DB
    P -- reads own history --> DB
    DB -- shared, portable record --> DR
    IA -- pays subscription --> MEDRA
    PP -- pays subscription --> MEDRA

    linkStyle default stroke:#5B6B7A,stroke-width:1.5px;
